&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;The actual rate of return for the pension plan&amp;#8217;s assets as of December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024 is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 417pt;" border="0" width="553" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 12.95pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="height: 12.95pt; width: 13pt;" width="17" height="17"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 13pt;" width="17"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 13pt;" width="17"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
