&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"&gt;At December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024, financial assets and liquidity resources available within one year for general expenditures, including operating expenses, scheduled principal payments on borrowings, and capital expenditures not financed with debt, include the cash and cash equivalents, accounts receivable and a revolving line of credit.&lt;/p&gt;
