&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"&gt;NYISO considers events and transactions that occur after the balance sheet date, but before the financial statements are issued, to provide additional evidence relative to certain estimates or to identify matters that require additional disclosure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"&gt;These financial statements were available to be issued on April 15, 2026 and subsequent events have been evaluated through that date. Based on this evaluation, NYISO is not aware of any events or transactions that occurred during the subsequent period that would require recognition or disclosure in the financial statements.&lt;/p&gt;
