  <ferc:DescriptionOfFiling id="Tag4309" contextRef="C464">Revisions to enable the NYISO to access additional funds, when needed, in order to resolve shortfalls in revenues recovered from its Transmission Customers to fund the NYISOs annual operating costs and Commission-assessed regulatory fees.</ferc:DescriptionOfFiling>
