  <ferc:DescriptionOfFiling id="Tag4337" contextRef="C471">NYISO filing to insert missing, previously accepted language from OATT Section 6.1.6 in ER12-2260-000 into the tariff records filed in Docket Nos. ER12-2598-000, ER12-2598-001, ER13-599-000, ER14-552-000, ER15-23445-000, ER15-2640-000, and ER15-2640-001</ferc:DescriptionOfFiling>
