  <ferc:DocumentDate id="Tag4339" contextRef="C472">2016-05-02</ferc:DocumentDate>
  <ferc:DocketNumber id="Tag4340" contextRef="C472">ER13-1942-003</ferc:DocketNumber>
  <ferc:DescriptionOfFiling id="Tag4341" contextRef="C472">When the NYISO filed, on July 18, 2012, revisions to OATT Section 6.1 in Docket No. ER12-2260-000 to be effective on April 5, 2012, it inadvertently omitted a version of the section including language that was filed on May 1, 2012 in ER12-718-001, to be effective January 15, 2013.  A corrected version of OATT Section 6.1, effective January 15, 2013, was filed in this proceeding (i.e., ER13-1942-003).</ferc:DescriptionOfFiling>
