  <ferc:DescriptionOfFiling id="Tag4380" contextRef="C483">NYISO compliance filing to set an effective date for tariff revisions regarding the establishment of a participation model for aggregations of resources, including Distributed Energy Resources.</ferc:DescriptionOfFiling>
